            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Large Community:</strong>
                Arduino has a huge ecosystem of tutorials, libraries, projects,
                documentation, and community resources.
            </li>

            <li>
                <strong>Real-World Applications:</strong>
                Arduino is useful for robotics, home automation, IoT prototypes,
                monitoring systems, and engineering projects.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>SEO Keywords to Target</h3>

        <p class="keywords">
            Arduino programming, Arduino tutorial, beginner Arduino guide,
