    <section id="conclusion">

        <h2>Conclusion</h2>

        <p>
            Learning how to program Arduino is an excellent way to combine
            programming with electronics and real-world applications.
        </p>

        <p>
            Start with simple projects such as blinking an LED and reading a button.
